  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Science for Service Partnership (CSSP) Brazil - Calls- tender-UNIVERSITY OF READING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collaborative climate science research programme between Brazil and UK to improve understanding of recent climate changes and Brazil&#x2019;s role in mitigation activities to inform international negotiations; to enhance projections of future weather and climate extremes and impacts to inform decision making and contribute to disaster risk reduction in Brazil. Research into Sub-seasonal and seasonal predictions for advancing climate services in Brazil. Specifically this grant will support the development of communication materials to support partner uptake of programme outputs.</narrative>
  </description>
